#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:6
msgid "Extending"
msgstr "Utvidga"

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:8
msgid ""
"The main direction for :mod:`asyncio` extending is writing custom *event "
"loop* classes. Asyncio has helpers that could be used to simplify this task."
msgstr ""
"Den huvudsakliga inriktningen för :mod:`asyncio`\\-utvidgning är att skriva "
"anpassade *event loop*-klasser. Asyncio har hjälpmedel som kan användas för "
"att förenkla denna uppgift."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:13
msgid ""
"Third-parties should reuse existing asyncio code with caution, a new Python "
"version is free to break backward compatibility in the *internal* part of "
"the API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:21
msgid "Writing a custom event loop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:23
msgid ""
":class:`asyncio.AbstractEventLoop` declares very many methods. "
"See :ref:`asyncio-event-loop-methods` for the full list. Implementing them "
"all from scratch is a tedious job."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:27
msgid ""
"A loop can get many common methods implementation for free by inheriting "
"from :class:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop`."
msgstr ""
"En loop kan få många vanliga metoder implementerade gratis genom att ärva "
"från :class:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:30
msgid ""
"In turn, the successor should implement a bunch of *private* methods "
"declared but not implemented in :class:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop`."
msgstr ""
"Efterträdaren ska i sin tur implementera ett antal *privata* metoder som "
"deklarerats men inte implementerats i :class:`asyncio.BaseEventLoop`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:33
msgid ""
"For example, ``loop.create_connection()`` checks arguments, resolves DNS "
"addresses, and calls ``loop._make_socket_transport()`` that should be "
"implemented by inherited class. The ``_make_socket_transport()`` method is "
"not documented and is considered as an *internal* API."
msgstr ""
"Till exempel kontrollerar ``loop.create_connection()`` argument, löser DNS-"
"adresser och anropar ``loop._make_socket_transport()`` som bör implementeras "
"av en ärvd klass. Metoden ``_make_socket_transport()`` är inte dokumenterad "
"och betraktas som ett *internt* API."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:41
msgid "Future and Task private constructors"
msgstr "Privata konstruktörer för Future och Task"

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:43
msgid ""
":class:`asyncio.Future` and :class:`asyncio.Task` should be never created "
"directly, please use corresponding :meth:`loop.create_future` "
"and :meth:`loop.create_task`, or :func:`asyncio.create_task` factories "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":class:`asyncio.Future` och :class:`asyncio.Task` bör aldrig skapas direkt, "
"använd istället motsvarande :meth:`loop.create_future` "
"och :meth:`loop.create_task`, eller :func:`asyncio.create_task` fabriker."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:47
msgid ""
"However, third-party *event loops* may *reuse* built-in future and task "
"implementations for the sake of getting a complex and highly optimized code "
"for free."
msgstr ""
"Tredjeparts *händelseslingor* kan dock *återanvända* inbyggda framtids- och "
"uppgiftsimplementeringar för att få en komplex och mycket optimerad kod "
"gratis."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:50
msgid "For this purpose the following, *private* constructors are listed:"
msgstr "För detta ändamål listas följande, *privata* konstruktörer:"

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:54
msgid "Create a built-in future instance."
msgstr "Skapa en inbyggd framtida instans."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:56
msgid "*loop* is an optional event loop instance."
msgstr "*loop* är en valfri instans för händelseslinga."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:60
msgid "Create a built-in task instance."
msgstr "Skapa en inbyggd uppgiftsinstans."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:62
msgid ""
"*loop* is an optional event loop instance. The rest of arguments are "
"described in :meth:`loop.create_task` description."
msgstr ""
"*loop* är en valfri instans för händelseslingan. Resten av argumenten "
"beskrivs i beskrivningen av :meth:`loop.create_task`."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:67
msgid "*context* argument is added."
msgstr "*context*-argumentet läggs till."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:72
msgid "Task lifetime support"
msgstr "Stöd för uppdragets livslängd"

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:74
msgid ""
"A third party task implementation should call the following functions to "
"keep a task visible by :func:`asyncio.all_tasks` "
"and :func:`asyncio.current_task`:"
msgstr ""
"En tredjepartsuppgiftsimplementering bör anropa följande funktioner för att "
"hålla en uppgift synlig för :func:`asyncio.all_tasks` "
"och :func:`asyncio.current_task`:"

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:79
msgid "Register a new *task* as managed by *asyncio*."
msgstr "Registrera en ny *task* som hanteras av *asyncio*."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:81
msgid "Call the function from a task constructor."
msgstr "Anropa funktionen från en task-konstruktör."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:85
msgid "Unregister a *task* from *asyncio* internal structures."
msgstr "Avregistrera en *task* från *asyncio* interna strukturer."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:87
msgid "The function should be called when a task is about to finish."
msgstr "Funktionen ska anropas när en uppgift är på väg att avslutas."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:91
msgid "Switch the current task to the *task* argument."
msgstr "Byt den aktuella uppgiften till argumentet *task*."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:93
msgid ""
"Call the function just before executing a portion of embedded *coroutine* "
"(:meth:`coroutine.send` or :meth:`coroutine.throw`)."
msgstr ""
"Anropa funktionen precis innan du utför en del av en inbäddad *coroutine* "
"(:meth:`coroutine.send` eller :meth:`coroutine.throw`)."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:98
msgid "Switch the current task back from *task* to ``None``."
msgstr "Byt tillbaka den aktuella uppgiften från *task* till ``None``."

#: ../../library/asyncio-extending.rst:100
msgid ""
"Call the function just after :meth:`coroutine.send` "
"or :meth:`coroutine.throw` execution."
msgstr ""
"Anropa funktionen precis efter att :meth:`coroutine.send` "
"eller :meth:`coroutine.throw` har körts."
